    "problem_statement": "Missing `group_send` method in InMemoryChannelLayer\n\nI noticed that the `group_send` method is missing from the `InMemoryChannelLayer` class. This method is essential for sending messages to channel groups.\n\nHere's a simple example showing the issue:\n\n```python\nfrom channels.layers import InMemoryChannelLayer\nimport asyncio\n\nasync def test_group_send():\n    layer = InMemoryChannelLayer()\n    \n    # Add a channel to a group\n    await layer.group_add(\"test_group\", \"test_channel\")\n    \n    # Try to send a message to the group\n    try:\n        await layer.group_send(\"test_group\", {\"type\": \"message\", \"text\": \"hello\"})\n        print(\"Message sent successfully\")\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"Error: {e}\")\n    \n    # Clean up\n    await layer.group_discard(\"test_group\", \"test_channel\")\n\n# Run the test\nasyncio.run(test_group_send())\n```\n\nWhen running this code, you'll get a `NotImplementedError` or an attribute error because the `group_send` method is missing from the `InMemoryChannelLayer` class.\n\nThis affects any application that uses channel groups with the in-memory channel layer, such as WebSocket consumers that use groups for broadcasting messages."
